<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!--
  Detekt baseline for smells that are real but not worth a risky rewrite right
  now. Prefer fixing the root cause over growing this file (see CLAUDE.md).

  Remaining categories (kept on purpose):
  - LongMethod / CyclomaticComplexMethod / LargeClass / TooManyFunctions on
    Compose screens and ViewModels: vertical UI flows where extracting more
    helpers hurts readability more than it helps.
  - MagicNumber for HTTP status codes, AudioFormat quality ranks, and YouTube
    Mix playlistId wire offsets (protocol literals clearer as numbers).
  - MaxLineLength on test fixtures / SQL / ytcfg HTML samples.
  - ParameterNaming on Compose onXyz callbacks (past-tense event names).
  - TooGenericExceptionCaught on ViewModel catch (Exception) UI error surfaces.
  - SwallowedException on intentional best-effort scrape/download paths.
  - MultipleEmitters on PlaylistContent (Compose list + empty state).
  - ComplexCondition on pagination / deeplink host matching.
  - ThrowsCount on download paths (DownloadAlbumUseCase / DownloadRepositoryImpl).

  Cleared (scrape/parse flatten): NestedBlockDepth / LoopWithTooManyJumpStatements
  / ReturnCount / ThrowsCount / CyclomaticComplexMethod on Dustvalve scrapers,
  HtmlUtils, and YouTube/YouTube Music parsers.
-->
